{"id":135,"name":"jolteon","speciesId":135,"dex":135,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["electric"],"stats":{"hp":65,"attack":65,"defense":60,"special-attack":110,"special-defense":95,"speed":130},"abilities":[{"name":"volt-absorb","hidden":false},{"name":"quick-feet","hidden":true}],"height":8,"weight":245,"baseExp":184,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/135.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/135.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/135.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/135.ogg","genus":"Lightning Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10000- volt lightning bolts."},{"version":"yellow","text":"A sensitive POKé­ MON that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power."},{"version":"gold","text":"It concentrates the weak electric charges emitted by its cells and launches wicked lightning bolts."},{"version":"silver","text":"Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity."},{"version":"crystal","text":"The negatively charged ions generated in its fur create a constant sparking noise."},{"version":"ruby","text":"JOLTEON’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the POKéMON to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its cells generate weak power that is amplified by its fur’s static electricity to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"version":"firered","text":"If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the fur on its body as if it were sharp needles."},{"version":"platinum","text":"If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches."},{"version":"black-2","text":"By storing electricity in its body, it can shoot its bristlelike fur like a barrage of missiles."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Jolteon’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the Pokémon to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles."},{"version":"sun","text":"They send out electrical charges of about 10,000 volts. Because they are high-strung, it can be difficult to grow close to them."},{"version":"moon","text":"When its fur stands on end, that’s a sign it’s about to give off a jolt of electricity. Take care, as sometimes lightning strikes next to it, too."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its lungs contain an organ that creates electricity. The crackling sound of electricity can be heard when it exhales."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its fur stands on end, becoming like needles it fires at enemies. Once they’re weakened, it finishes them off with a 10,000 volt shock."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A sensitive Pokémon that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Bristles its fur into sharp, needlelike points when enraged. One can hear electricity crackle in its breath when it exhales."}],"genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"eevee","speciesId":133,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Usar Water Stone"],"species":"vaporeon","speciesId":134,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Usar Thunder Stone"],"species":"jolteon","speciesId":135